			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Omens of War Expansion Thoughts.. &nbsp;(Read 1302 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=3" title="View the profile of EQSysquella">EQSysquella</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								GO GO NERFED DPS<br />
								Guild Officer<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 1167<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								Grem&#039;s Parole Officer<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=EQSysquella&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="EQSysquella" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=3"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.pitbosscchc.com/" title="Official Pitboss Website" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:JusPlay77@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7810#msg7810"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7810#msg7810">Omens of War Expansion Thoughts..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> May 07, 2004, 11:56:16 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I was drinking with some friends and the expansion was brought up-- And more importantly, how it will effect the current GoD expansion as well as <i>Rodcet Nife</i>.<br /><br />First off, there will be a level increase (Didn&#039;t specify exactly, but I will guess Level 70 or 75), due to the fact that level incriments have been 5 or 10<br /><br />What does this mean??<br /><br />* Melee will jump into a new attack bracket<br />* Players will have higher hp/mana/ac<br />* Mobs will be less resistant to you<br />* You will resist mobs easier<br />* Your aggro range will seem shortened to certain mobs. &nbsp;ie: a mob that may have aggrod you at 65 running by, won&#039;t at 70/75- making pulls easier perhaps<br /><br />This is just the basic shit.. of course they also told us that there will be new spells, new disciplines, new aa&#039;s! &nbsp;And of course Epic 2 which I will predict now WON&#039;T be the wpn of all wpns end game.. (In fact I would place any wager on that)...<br /><br />--<br /><br />Ok, now that you have all this in mind, think about guilds currently struggling with GoD.. (even #1 guilds have had jaw dropping moments). &nbsp; <br /><br />I could see Ascent getting 70s + conquering GoD like nothing- as well as other #1guilds per server.<br /><br />Perhaps Guilds like Hegemony, UoP, Conviction, RoS etc all hit 70 and fly through Time like butter, then struggle a tad through Uqua/Qvic but nothing major.. &nbsp;How will Omens of War be?? make Uqua look like TOV?? Or perhaps a wider range of high end.. (Similar to PoN/PoJ compared to Ele).. &nbsp;<br /><br />So basically, it all comes down to SoE not designing the expansions with any sense at all.. They either think GoD is impossible for the guilds to win, so they add this expansion to assist.. or they are trying to compete with Lineage 2 with another half assed expansion.. OR they notice that top guilds serverwide that keep others interested by progression + hope of winning.. disbanding..<br /><br />Ok my now buzzed state of mind is going to bed ~<br /><br />LONG LIVE SOE.. /cough
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 08, 2004, 12:09:51 am by EQSysquella</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=586624" target="_blank"> <img src="http://members.cox.net/rtmjohnson/Daisy.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><br /><b>Duke Sysquella Armana</b><br />65 Paladin<br />Officer of Fires of Time<br /><i>Dkp Team Lead</i><br /><br />&quot;Phase 1 is like chewing on broken glass, but I&#039;d prefer the glass. . .&quot;<br /></div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7811"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=207" title="View the profile of Uuldiin">Uuldiin</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 110<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.strike9.com/file.ashx?path=%2fuuldiin21%2ffullsize%2fa02kasumi50.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Fuck You<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=207"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7811#msg7811"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7811#msg7811">Re:Omens of War Expansion Thoughts..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> May 08, 2004, 12:52:16 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							While Epic v2 is something to raise an eyebrow at (hell, i play a war /cringe), i think i&#039;m going to attempt to get into the Beta first... Hell its the best way to see if you like the game, cuase you damn well know nothing in the beta gets fixed ;p. &nbsp;However if not accepted obviously gona wait till someone finishes, and i agree i highly doubt it will be &quot;weapons of all weapons&quot;, &nbsp;i&#039;m fairly certain they will be in-line with the berserker epic.<br /><br />As for levels, Jesh isnt 65 of them enough? god forbid they make 65-70/75 Hell levels, &nbsp;On the topic of AA&#039;s, &nbsp;Why even bother? they have bumped out just about every idea via AA&#039;s in 760+ AAs possible per class, &nbsp;There&#039;s nothing left to keep people interesting in grinding them, unless they pull a rabit out of a large ass (ie: dont fuck it up with retarded AAs like lasting breath).<br /><br />Agro: i highly doubt that will make a huge change, &nbsp;There is still numerous zones / encounter&#039;s that are not even affected by this. &nbsp; 90% of the time this happen&#039;s in Old world / kunark era.<br /><br />Higher HP , Mana , AC i highly doubt, &nbsp;Take warrior&#039;s for instance. &nbsp;From i think its 60 (big hp boost for wars at 60) to 65, The warrior only gains around 123 / 150 HP overall, &nbsp;I&#039;am not entirely sure how much a caster &nbsp; / priest gains but doesnt seem very large.<br /><br /><br />All i can think of this late.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7812"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=3" title="View the profile of EQSysquella">EQSysquella</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								GO GO NERFED DPS<br />
								Guild Officer<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 1167<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								Grem&#039;s Parole Officer<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=EQSysquella&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="EQSysquella" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=3"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.pitbosscchc.com/" title="Official Pitboss Website" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:JusPlay77@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7812#msg7812"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7812#msg7812">Re:Omens of War Expansion Thoughts..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> May 08, 2004, 01:48:41 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							cant sleep~ anyways, The epics will be better than the zerker.. as in fact they will have a 2nd epic too.. &nbsp;I could see them being perhaps similar to the ifir/sews/staff of zha series of weapons.. &nbsp;even as for casters the poeb 1hander similar stats.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> Take warrior&#039;s for instance. &nbsp;From i think its 60 (big hp boost for wars at 60) to 65, The warrior only gains around 123 / 150 HP overall,<br /></div><br />573hp is gained from 60-65 with all hp-related aa&#039;s.. which is a significant jump
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
