									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Xaanru 65th lvl Archon of Marr <br />Sons of Kings guild <br />Rodcet Nife <br />Tradeskills<br />GrandMaster Smith(250) ** GM Trophy<br />Master Baker(200)<br />Master Fletcher (200)<br />Master Jeweler (200)<br />Master Brewer (200)<br />Master Tailor (238)<br />Master Potter (194)<br />Master Fisherman (186)<br />Master Drunk (188)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7818"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=333" title="View the profile of Cyquinn">Cyquinn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/weasel.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Random_Spectator_01<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=333"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7818#msg7818"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7818#msg7818">Re:Omens of War Expansion Thoughts..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> May 08, 2004, 12:56:12 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Let&#039;s see...the current high end in GoD is making the uber/hardcore players retire in droves.<br /><br />The difficulty of GoD keeps most of the casual player base from even going there.<br /><br />The recent patches have effectively broken EQ for a lot of people - mobs are untargettable, graphical glitches abound, and even walking through the Plane of Knowledge now gives you a random chance to freeze up (well, for some of us). <br /><br />In an especially well thought out scheme, Sony seems to be making GoD, part II instead of fixing the current problems. <br /><br />/sigh<br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Marshall Cyquinn Davion
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
