	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7828"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=56" title="View the profile of chidder">chidder</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 69<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Iks war so Powa<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=56"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7828#msg7828"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=818.msg7828#msg7828">Re:Omens of War Expansion Thoughts..</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> May 09, 2004, 07:11:29 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Don&#039;t forget there putting in something to prevent people from leveling past 65 untill a certian number of aa&#039;s. This number could be low but could be as high as say 300? If it is 300 then the majority of players in guilds like heg / conv / etc won&#039;t be able to level to 70 all that easy. Many players have little time outside of raiding to grind. While guilds like ascent every player is atleast at 250 - 300 aa&#039;s &nbsp;most in that kind of level guild so it basiclly isn&#039;t to much a concern. Its a good thing though because a level 70 with 0 aa&#039;s probubly wouldn&#039;t be effecetive at all. More realisticly the number will be 150-200 aa&#039;s before you can be level 70 but who the fuck knows with the eq developers anymore...<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
