							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							That was a rumor started before GoD when everyone thought the level cap was going to be increased. Also, it really has nothing to do with what guild you&#039;re in as to how many AA you have. Thats pretty irrelevent, Look at ppl like Delheru. Granted at least having elemental access makes it easier to have more.
